  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "*Ahí tenemos su tiempo medio de entrenamiento para un train 2/3 del tamaño del origina (recuerda que cv = 3)*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "*Con vistas a comparar el resultado, vamos a hacer un entrenamiento completo para almecenar los tiempos y luego guardaremos los valores en un diccionario y una lista (para crear un dataframe de comparación)*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 39,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "t_zero = time()\n",
    "clf.best_estimator_.fit(train_set,y_train)\n",
    "tiempo_rf = time() - t_zero"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 40,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "0.2717163562774658"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 40,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "tiempo_rf"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "*Y obtenemos también los tiempos de inferencia*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 41,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "0.0265810489654541"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 41,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "t_zero = time()\n",
    "y_pred = clf.best_estimator_.predict(test_set)\n",
    "tiempo_rf_test = time() - t_zero\n",
    "tiempo_rf_test"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "*Obtengamos las medida con test*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 42,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.metrics import precision_score, accuracy_score\n",
    "\n",
    "precision_media_rf = precision_score(y_test, y_pred, average = \"macro\")\n",
    "recall_media_rf = recall_score(y_test, y_pred, average = \"macro\")\n",
    "accuracy_rf = accuracy_score(y_test, y_pred)"
   ]
  },
  {
