  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 46,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "(712, 23)"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 46,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "X_train.shape"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 47,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "num_features = X_train.shape[1]\n",
    "\n",
    "parameter_space = {\n",
    "    'modelo__hidden_layer_sizes': [(50,), (100,), (50,50), (100,100), (50,50,50), (100,100,100)],\n",
    "    'modelo__activation': ['tanh', 'relu'],\n",
    "    'modelo__solver': ['sgd', 'adam'],  #  Ci = Ci_old - learning_rate * C'i -> Ci; Adam => Ci = Ci_old - learning_rate * (Beta1*(media(C'i)-  Beta2*(media((C''i)) - C'i), constante, adapatativo -> (creciendo a medida que entreno, decreciendo a medoda que entreno)\n",
    "    'modelo__alpha': [0.0001, 0.05],\n",
    "    'modelo__learning_rate': ['constant','adaptive']\n",
    "}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "* Niguno en la de entrada\n",
    "* Capa 1: (25 + 1) * 100 \n",
    "* Capa 2: (100 +1) * 100\n",
    "* Capa 3: (100 +1) * 100\n",
    "* Capa de Salida: (100+1)* 1\n",
    "2600 + 10100 + 10100 + 101 =  22901"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### hidden_layer_size"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "*El primer parámetro nos permite crear la topología en concreto, vamos a probar 6 topologías, con 1,2 y 3 capas ocultas y 50 y 100 unidades por capa oculta. Recuerda que el MLP de sklearn no te deja tocar la entrada ni la salida.*  \n",
    "```python\n",
    "'hidden_layer_sizes': [(50,), (100,), (50,50), (100,100),(50,50,50),(100,100,100)]\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 48,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# w1*x1 + w2*x2 + w3*x3 + w4*x4 + b # weights & bias"
   ]
  },
  {
   "attachments": {
    "31e20de2-caa1-459b-9077-5512643f1836.png": {
     "image/png": "